Purpose: Delete a customer by their ID
•	Method: DELETE
•	URL: http://localhost:8080/api/customers/1
•	Headers: None required
•	Body: None
Expected Response (Success):
json
"Customer deleted successfully"
Expected Response (Not Found): HTTP 404 if customer ID doesn't exist
