4. 📄 PAGINATION ENDPOINT
GET /api/customers/page?page=0&size=5
Purpose: Get customers with pagination support
•	Method: GET
•	URL: http://localhost:8080/api/customers/page?page=0&size=5
•	Headers: None required
•	Body: None
Query Parameters:
•	page: Page number (0-based)
•	size: Number of records per page
Expected Response:
json
{
  "content": [
    // Array of 5 customer objects
  ],
  "pageable": {
    "pageNumber": 0,
    "pageSize": 5,
    "sort": {
      "empty": true,
      "sorted": false,
      "unsorted": true
    }
  },
  "totalPages": 10,
  "totalElements": 50,
  "last": false,
  "size": 5,
  "number": 0
}
________________________________________
5. 📊 STATISTICS ENDPOINT
GET /api/customers/statistics
Purpose: Get comprehensive statistics about the customer data
•	Method: GET
•	URL: http://localhost:8080/api/customers/statistics
•	Headers: None required
•	Body: None
Expected Response:
json
{
  "totalCustomers": 50,
  "customersWithValidDob": 45,
  "customersWithFormattedPhones": 25,
  "countryDistribution": [
    ["USA", 10],
    ["India", 8],
    ["Canada", 5],
    ["UK", 4],
    // ... more countries
  ]
}
Statistics Explained:
•	totalCustomers: Total number of customer records
•	customersWithValidDob: Customers with non-empty date of birth
•	customersWithFormattedPhones: Customers with properly formatted phone numbers
•	countryDistribution: Array of [country, count] pairs showing customer distribution by country
